t\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"right\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于混合方向的内容（如阿拉伯语中嵌入英文），使用 Unicode 双向算法和 <code>&lt;bdi&gt;</code> 标签：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;p dir=&quot;rtl&quot;&gt;اسم المستخدم: &lt;bdi&gt;john_doe_123&lt;/bdi&gt; مسجل بنجاح&lt;/p&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dir</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rtl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>اسم المستخدم: &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">bdi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>john_doe_123&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">bdi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> مسجل بنجاح&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"图标与视觉元素方向\">图标与视觉元素方向</h2><p>图标分为两类：方向性图标（箭头、返回、前进）需要在 RTL 中镜像，非方向性图标（搜索、设置、收藏）保持不变：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"[dir=&#39;rtl&#39;] .icon-arrow-right,&#10;[dir=&#39;rtl&#39;] .icon-chevron-right,&#10;[dir=&#39;rtl&#39;] .icon-forward,&#10;[dir=&#39;rtl&#39;] .icon-back {&#10;  transform: scaleX(-1);&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 进度条方向适配 */&#10;.progress-bar {&#10;  direction: inherit;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.progress-fill {&#10;  transform-origin: inline-start;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 滚动条 — 浏览器自动处理 */&#10;/* 轮播图 — 需要反转滑动方向 */&#10;.carousel[dir=&#39;rtl&#39;] {&#10;  direction: rtl;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rtl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.icon-arrow-right</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rtl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.icon-chevron-right</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rtl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.icon-forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rtl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.icon-back</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scaleX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 进度条方向适配 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.progress-bar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">inherit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.progress-fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transform-origin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">inline-start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 滚动条 — 浏览器自动处理 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 轮播图 — 需要反转滑动方向 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.carousel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rtl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rtl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图标类型</th>\n<th>RTL 处理</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方向性箭头</td>\n<td>水平镜像</td>\n<td>←/→, 返回, 前进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列表缩进</td>\n<td>镜像</td>\n<td>项目符号, 折叠展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>媒体控制</td>\n<td>不镜像</td>\n<td>播放, 暂停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具图标</td>\n<td>不镜像</td>\n<td>搜索, 设置, 删除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对号/叉号</td>\n<td>不镜像</td>\n<td>✓, ✗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间线/进度</td>\n<td>需镜像</td>\n<td>步骤条, 进度条</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"rtl-测试策略\">RTL 测试策略</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RtlTestCase {&#10;  category: string;&#10;  checkPoints: string[];&#10;  automatable: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const rtlTestPlan: RtlTestCase[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    category: &#39;布局方向&#39;,&#10;    checkPoints: [&#39;导航栏从右到左排列&#39;, &#39;侧边栏位于右侧&#39;, &#39;面包屑箭头方向正确&#39;],&#10;    automatable: true,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    category: &#39;文本对齐&#39;,&#10;    checkPoints: [&#39;段落文本右对齐&#39;, &#39;数字和英文嵌入方向正确&#39;, &#39;表单标签在输入框右侧&#39;],&#10;    automatable: true,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    category: &#39;交互反馈&#39;,&#10;    checkPoints: [&#39;滑动手势方向正确&#39;, &#39;动画方向正确&#39;, &#39;弹出菜单方向正确&#39;],&#10;    automatable: false,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RtlTestCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  category</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  checkPoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  automatable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rtlTestPlan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RtlTestCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    category: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'布局方向'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    checkPoints: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'导航栏从右到左排列'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'侧边栏位于右侧'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'面包屑箭头方向正确'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    automatable: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    category: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'文本对齐'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    checkPoints: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'段落文本右对齐'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数字和英文嵌入方向正确'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'表单标签在输入框右侧'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    automatable: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    category: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'交互反馈'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    checkPoints: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'滑动手势方向正确'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'动画方向正确'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'弹出菜单方向正确'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    automatable: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CSS Logical Properties 用逻辑方向替代物理方向，是 RTL 适配的现代标准方案</li>\n<li>Flexbox 和 Grid 天然支持 RTL，自动反转元素排列方向</li>\n<li>HTML <code>dir</code> 属性是 RTL 布局的基础，需在根元素正确设置</li>\n<li>方向性图标（箭头、返回）需要镜像，非方向性图标（搜索、设置）保持不变</li>\n<li>transform、box-shadow 和 absolute 定位需要特别处理</li>\n<li>RTL 测试应覆盖布局方向、文本对齐和交互反馈三个维度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RTL 布局适配","id":"rtl-布局适配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CSS 逻辑属性实践","id":"css-逻辑属性实践"},{"level":2,"text":"HTML 方向控制","id":"html-方向控制"},{"level":2,"text":"图标与视觉元素方向","id":"图标与视觉元素方向"},{"level":2,"text":"RTL 测试策略","id":"rtl-测试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文本与消息格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals/text-formatting"},"next":{"title":"文本方向与双向文本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals/text-direction"}}